[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:The End of a Dream]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:11.05]How did the dream end? | 美梦是怎样结束的？
[00:15.15]Tired of sleeping on the floor, | 由于厌倦了睡地板，
[00:18.01]a young man in Teheran saved up for years to buy a real bed. | 德黑兰的一个年轻人积攒了多年买了张真正的床。
[00:24.98]For the first time in his life, | 他平生第一次
[00:28.05]he became the proud owner of a bed which had springs and a mattress. | 拥有了带弹簧和床垫的床，感到非常自豪。
[00:35.22]Because the weather was very hot, | 由于天气很炎热，
[00:38.62]he carried the bed on to the roof of his house. | 他便把床搬到了自家屋顶上。
[00:43.36]He slept very well for the first two nights, | 头两夜他睡得非常好，
[00:48.00]but on the third night, a storm blew up. | 但第三夜刮起了风暴。
[00:53.12]A gust of wind swept the bed off the roof and sent it crashing into the courtyard below. | 一阵狂风把床刮离屋顶，把它甩到了下面的院子里。
[01:02.03]The young man did not wake up | 年轻人直到
[01:04.44]until the bed had struck the ground. | 床撞到地上才醒来。
[01:08.46]Although the bed was smashed to pieces, | 尽管床被摔成了碎片，
[01:12.03]the man was miraculously unhurt. | 年轻人却奇迹般地没有受伤。
[01:16.21]When he woke up, he was still on the mattress. | 醒来时，他仍然躺在床垫上。
[01:20.84]Glancing at the bits of wood and metal that lay around him, | 看着周围散落的木头和金属碎片，
[01:25.72]the man sadly picked up the mattress and carried it into his house. | 年轻人伤心地拾起床垫，把它扛进了屋里。
[01:31.82]After he had put it on the floor, | 他把床垫放在地板上之后，
[01:34.56]he promptly went to sleep again. | 很快又睡着了。
